and that's like 26 miles...

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:26.200
I mean all the way to San Pedro,
that's like 26 miles away.

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:27.710
So that's a lot of...

00:02:29.253 --> 00:02:30.290
- [Interviewer] Well, I think
they call it Figue-hoe-a

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:32.038
