that are working there.

00:02:32.038 --> 00:02:37.038
- Right, 26 miles. From
Jefferson all the way down.

00:02:37.140 --> 00:02:38.950
It's the longest straight
street all the way down

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:40.096
