00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:46.240
- Yeah, wow. I had pulled up in the car

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:53.942
with a person that at that
time was my significant other.

00:02:53.942 --> 00:02:58.942
And when we pulled up, I
was going into the store

00:02:58.960 --> 00:03:00.740
to purchase a few things and I asked her,

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:03.010
you know I was asking her what she wanted.

00:03:03.010 --> 00:03:05.568
And a guy pushed up on
me. I had the door open

00:03:05.568 --> 00:03:09.064
and a guy pushed up on me and he said,

00:03:09.064 --> 00:03:12.210
"Say, man, give me a quarter."

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:14.690
And I didn't like the
way he asked. You know.

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:17.880
Because it was more of a
demand, it was like, aggressive.

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:20.003
And so, you know, I looked
at him and told him,

00:03:20.003 --> 00:03:23.637
"I don't have a quarter." I
lied. But it was a reaction.

00:03:23.637 --> 00:03:26.757
"I don't have a quarter."
And he said, you know

00:03:26.757 --> 00:03:29.160
"You's the n-word, you
a mother-fucking liar.

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:30.570
You've got a quarter." I looked at him.

00:03:30.570 --> 00:03:34.270
I was like, "Man, you
disrespected my family here."

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:38.640
He said, "Fuck your family."
And my natural reaction was

00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:40.263
you know well the talking is over,

00:03:40.263 --> 00:03:45.263
so the conversation was
over and I fired on him.

00:03:45.630 --> 00:03:49.060
He went back and I was angry at this time

00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:51.210
because he was, you know it was more like,

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:54.064
not that he disrespected
her, he disrespected me.

00:03:54.064 --> 00:03:56.100
I mean, of course he
disrespect her, but it was more

00:03:56.100 --> 00:03:58.174
he did it in my presence
and make me look like

00:03:58.174 --> 00:04:02.970
I'm Willy Foofoo or Sammy
Sausage and I wasn't going for it

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:06.297
so I engaged him and I drove him back

00:04:06.297 --> 00:04:10.680
because he didn't expect in
that first one when I hit him

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:13.150
you know, kind of had him spinning.

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:16.360
So we went back, about four or five houses

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:18.510
and she jumped out the
car and she was screaming

00:04:18.510 --> 00:04:22.730
