and he turned and he ran.

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:27.750
And this time I disengaged, you know,

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:28.940
I was figuring he learned his lesson.

00:04:28.940 --> 00:04:31.300
I turned around, I was walking
back. I was still angry

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:33.850
and she was still hollering.
I wasn't really paying

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:35.585
attention to her. And
suddenly he came in you know.

00:04:35.585 --> 00:04:39.199
She said, "Look out behind
you" and I turned around

00:04:39.199 --> 00:04:41.793
and he was swinging a pick ax.

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:45.800
That's the one that the miners used,

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:48.190
you know to dig, both ends are pointy.

00:04:48.190 --> 00:04:49.947
I think it's an eight pound head

00:04:51.773 --> 00:04:56.070
and 28 inched from tip to
tip, both tips are pointy.

00:04:56.070 --> 00:04:58.790
And it was already in
motion, and I watched it,

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:02.690
I watched it in slow motion. I
watched it go through the air

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:06.140
arch and hit me in the chest.
It hit me in the top part

00:05:06.140 --> 00:05:08.519
of my pectoral, it came out
under my arm because it's curved

00:05:08.519 --> 00:05:12.480
and it stuck me in the left
arm. And I'm looking at it

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:14.970
and when it hit me you could hear a boom.

00:05:14.970 --> 00:05:17.278
And the next thing you
know, I was looking up

00:05:17.278 --> 00:05:18.401
and I was down on my knees,
I was down on one knee.

00:05:18.401 --> 00:05:22.060
And I looked down at
the pick ax through me

00:05:22.060 --> 00:05:25.480
and I seen the shape of the
pick ax pucker through the skin

00:05:25.480 --> 00:05:30.480
and I was like, "Man,
I'm dead. Got to be."

00:05:30.780 --> 00:05:33.390
I thought it came out my back, you know.

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:34.840
Went straight through the
heart and everything else

00:05:34.840 --> 00:05:36.980
like Count Dracula, or somebody.

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:39.611
But it had stuck me in the
arm and I was paralyzed

00:05:39.611 --> 00:05:41.063
and I looked up at him
and I tried to stand up

00:05:41.063 --> 00:05:43.740
and he pulled it out.
When he pulled it out

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:46.520
blood came with it, lot of it,

00:05:46.520 --> 00:05:49.437
like a bucket of blood came out,

00:05:49.437 --> 00:05:51.597
that's what it looked like to me.

00:05:51.597 --> 00:05:53.510
And so I made it up to my feet,

00:05:53.510 --> 00:05:55.890
and now I was trying to disengage

00:05:55.890 --> 00:05:58.150
cause I was getting the
shitty end of the stick.

00:05:58.150 --> 00:06:00.340
And he swung it side, "Hit
me again, mother fucker,"

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:04.430
and he swung it sideways. I
couldn't utilize my left arm

00:06:04.430 --> 00:06:06.340
cause it was paralyzed from the strike

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:10.920
and so I turned my body and I
took the ax handle on the arm

00:06:10.920 --> 00:06:14.020
but the pick is so long
that it went around

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:16.420
and went in my back, punctured my lung.

00:06:16.420 --> 00:06:19.490
And I felt it. It was
like a balloon popped,

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:23.060
and I couldn't breath, you
know. And all the air just...

00:06:24.470 --> 00:06:29.470
So at this time, I moved back
and he went for the third shot

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:32.663
he went for a head shot. And
this time, Dr. Jekyll left

00:06:32.663 --> 00:06:37.090
and Mr. Hyde showed up. Mr.
Hyde showed up and saved my ass

00:06:37.090 --> 00:06:39.350
a whole bunch of times.
When Dr. Jekyll can't do it

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:43.652
Mr. Hyde can. So I was able
to... the adrenaline surged

00:06:43.652 --> 00:06:46.473
I broke the paralysis and I reached up

00:06:46.473 --> 00:06:48.140
and I caught the pick ax
while he was swinging it.

00:06:48.140 --> 00:06:50.800
It hit me in the palm of the hand.

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:53.790
And I moved it to the
side and I fired on him.

00:06:53.790 --> 00:06:57.360
So he went back several
steps and I hit him again.

00:06:57.360 --> 00:06:59.420
Now he was dizzy cause I
was giving it all I got,

00:06:59.420 --> 00:07:01.470
even though I didn't have a lot left.

00:07:01.470 --> 00:07:04.060
So we dropped the pick
ax, and I pushed him back

00:07:04.060 --> 00:07:05.962
to a worth iron gate and I took his shirt

00:07:05.962 --> 00:07:09.210
