they had so much blood in them.

00:07:18.875 --> 00:07:21.310
And I backed up, I stepped on the pick ax

00:07:21.310 --> 00:07:23.853
and I looked down and I
saw it. Now it's my turn.

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:26.070
So I reached down, picked it up

00:07:26.070 --> 00:07:28.240
and I took two giant leaps toward him

00:07:28.240 --> 00:07:31.150
and I was fixin', I was
fixin' to stake him out.

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:33.290
But she was hollering, "No,
please don't, please don't."

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:35.760
And I stopped, and this time I was crying

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:38.310
because I was so angry.
And I turned it around

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:40.570
and this is a awkward way to hold it,

00:07:40.570 --> 00:07:45.430
