and he came off the gate.

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:50.157
And he was crawling, talking about

00:07:50.157 --> 00:07:52.470
"Help. Help. Somebody call the police."

00:07:52.470 --> 00:07:53.920
I said, "Mother fucker,
you didn't call the police

00:07:53.920 --> 00:07:55.760
