beat him across the street.

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:03.720
He was crawling, and I beat
him til he couldn't move.

00:08:03.720 --> 00:08:06.290
He was down. And I was just...

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:07.430
I couldn't move my arms no more,

00:08:07.430 --> 00:08:08.810
that's the only reason I stopped,

00:08:08.810 --> 00:08:11.090
cause my arms felt like lead.

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:12.637
So I threw the pick ax down, and I turned

00:08:12.637 --> 00:08:15.441
