to her. And she came up.

00:08:15.441 --> 00:08:16.930
She said, "You got bubbles
coming out your back."

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:19.030
I said, "My lung is punctured."

00:08:19.030 --> 00:08:20.870
Another dude came out the
house with some towels.

00:08:20.870 --> 00:08:24.940
He put one on my back
and put one on my chest.

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:29.420
So, as we went to the car
I said, "Give me the keys."

00:08:29.420 --> 00:08:30.850
She said, "You can't drive.
You going to pass out."

00:08:30.850 --> 00:08:33.600
I said, "Give me the keys,
man." So she gave me the keys.

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:35.040
When we got to the car I thought about it.

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:36.840
I said, "You know what? On
second thought you better drive."

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:41.840
Gave her the keys cause
she might be right.

00:08:41.960 --> 00:08:44.410
So, anyway, she said, "I'm
taking you to the hospital."

00:08:44.410 --> 00:08:46.020
I said, "No, you're not." I said, "Take me

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:48.480
to my mom's house." "No, I'm
taking you to the hospital."

00:08:48.480 --> 00:08:52.080
I said, "I know what I'm doing.
Take me to my mom's house."

00:08:52.080 --> 00:08:54.314
So we headed for the Crenshaw
district. And she's speeding

00:08:54.314 --> 00:08:57.420
and running red lights.
I said, "Man, slow down

00:08:57.420 --> 00:08:59.900
before you kill not just
me, yourself as well.

00:08:59.900 --> 00:09:01.770
So slow down." She said,
"You just passed out."

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:03.949
I said, " No, I didn't. I
heard everything you said."

00:09:03.949 --> 00:09:05.747
She asked me, "What did I say?"

00:09:05.747 --> 00:09:10.020
And I repeated it verbatim.
So she slowed down somewhat.

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:13.250
We pulled up and I said,
"Okay. I got my alias name.

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:16.290
This is my new name. This
is how we going to do this.

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:18.210
We was over at the mall,
the shopping center.

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:20.032
Some dudes messed with the car. I came up,

00:09:20.032 --> 00:09:23.740
and one of them just
hit me with a pick ax.

00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:25.450
That's the story we going
to feed to the police

00:09:25.450 --> 00:09:27.310
and everybody else when they get there.

00:09:27.310 --> 00:09:29.160
So she got out the car
and she ran into the house

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:31.360
to call the ambulance. And I decided

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:33.340
I'm going to get out and go in the house.

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:35.670
As I was walking I seen
them gigantic, bloody,

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:40.000
I wear size 15. So again, I say
gigantic, bloody footprints.

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:42.500
And I was like, "I'm not fixin'
to walk in my mom's house

00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:44.473
and leave her with the clean-up.

00:09:45.530 --> 00:09:48.280
So I sat down in the hallway
right outside of her door.

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:54.020
My mom came ut crying, "No,
no, not again. Not my son.

00:09:54.020 --> 00:09:56.560
Don't take this one."
She was pleading with God

00:09:56.560 --> 00:09:58.793
cause she figured I was on death's bed.

00:09:59.810 --> 00:10:02.897
So, I told my niece, who
was maintaining my mom,

00:10:02.897 --> 00:10:06.288
"Take he back inside." She
she got her off inside.

00:10:06.288 --> 00:10:10.090
My girl came back out and she
said, "They're on their way."

00:10:10.090 --> 00:10:12.120
So I fed her the story
again. I said, "You got it?

00:10:12.120 --> 00:10:15.910
Okay, good." When they came,
when the ambulance came

00:10:16.969 --> 00:10:21.570
they asked me what had happened.
You know, I fed the a lie

00:10:21.570 --> 00:10:26.072
and they cut my shirt off. I
said, "And he bust my lung."

00:10:26.072 --> 00:10:26.905
He said, "How do you know?"

00:10:26.905 --> 00:10:27.738
I said, "Because I couldn't breath.

00:10:27.738 --> 00:10:29.507
I still have difficulty breathing."

00:10:30.610 --> 00:10:32.270
So he cut the shirt off,
he looked at the back,

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:34.830
a nice size hole. I said,
"They also hit me in the arm."

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:37.663
Picked my left arm up and
there it was, a gigantic hole.

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:43.670
So, that was the last thing
I remember until I woke up

00:10:46.170 --> 00:10:48.240
and I looked at my girl. She's standing

00:10:48.240 --> 00:10:50.820
at the foot of the bed. I said,
"How long I've been here?"

00:10:50.820 --> 00:10:54.760
She said, "About four days."
I said, "That's why I'm

00:10:54.760 --> 00:10:58.948
hungrier than a mother fucker.
I need something to eat."

00:10:58.948 --> 00:11:02.141
And she was like, "Well,
they've got some food

00:11:02.141 --> 00:11:05.890
in the vending machine
in tower number two."

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:07.850
I said, "Well, you got a big ass coat on.

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:10.570
Walk your ass over there." I
wasn't really making sense.

00:11:10.570 --> 00:11:14.555
I just came out of it.
She said, "All right.

00:11:14.555 --> 00:11:16.810
But can I touch you before I leave?"

00:11:16.810 --> 00:11:18.780
I said, "Touch me? Why you ask me that?"

00:11:18.780 --> 00:11:20.470
She said, "Because the
last time I touched you

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:23.180
you said, Bitch, get you hands off of me."

00:11:23.180 --> 00:11:27.277
I said, "They giving me morphine."
Because I had a military

00:11:27.277 --> 00:11:29.829
experience where each
time they shot me up,

00:11:29.829 --> 00:11:33.870
they shot me up, I engaged.
I engaged the corpsmen,

00:11:33.870 --> 00:11:36.810
I engaged the doctor and
everybody else who was around.

00:11:36.810 --> 00:11:38.530
So, I knew what they was giving me because

00:11:38.530 --> 00:11:40.810
I lived through this before. It had to be,

00:11:40.810 --> 00:11:44.203
when I act that way it has
to be that particular drug.

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:47.100
So, she went out and asked the nurse.

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:50.490
And the nurse said, "Yes." She
explained, he goes like this.

00:11:50.490 --> 00:11:53.520
This is the reason he was
going off on everybody.

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:55.780
So, they told me they was
going to change the medication,

00:11:55.780 --> 00:11:59.620
but it still had to wear
off. She came back in

00:11:59.620 --> 00:12:04.620
and told me what had happened. Told me how

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:08.860
they had stitched up some,
left the other ones open

00:12:08.860 --> 00:12:09.717
because they didn't want me...

00:12:09.717 --> 00:12:10.570
They wanted me to heal
from the inside out.

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:12.370
I mean, I've been through
that a lot of times.

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:14.850
When a wound is so sever they want it

00:12:14.850 --> 00:12:17.390
to heal from the inside
instead of closing up.

00:12:17.390 --> 00:12:20.623
It might fester inside
and become infected.

00:12:21.540 --> 00:12:25.936
So, yeah. When I said I
got hit with a pick ax,

00:12:25.936 --> 00:12:30.233
yeah, I got hit with a pick ax.

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:32.820
- [Interviewer] All right,
Repeat. Well, thank you

00:12:32.820 --> 00:12:35.184
so much for coming in again.

00:12:35.184 --> 00:12:39.460
- Man, I appreciate it. I appreciate it.

00:12:39.460 --> 00:12:40.840
