to hear that you might

00:12:40.840 --> 00:12:41.673
be getting out of here.

00:12:41.673 --> 00:12:45.420
- Yeah, the thing is, in 31 years

00:12:45.420 --> 00:12:47.571
I didn't have an opportunity or a chance

00:12:47.571 --> 00:12:51.360
